A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.2.35; 
son of: Jarha (H3398) and Ahlai (H0304); 
father of: Nathan (H5416J)
§ Attai = "opportune"
1) a Judaite, grandson of Sheshan the Jerahmeelite by daughter Ahlai whom he gave in marriage to Jarha, his Egyptian slave; his grandson Zabad was one of David's mighty warriors
2) one of the lion-faced warriors of Gad, captains…

